[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9361.269, "timestamp": "02:36:01", "text": "你知道，你知道，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9364.389, "timestamp": "02:36:04", "text": "这里有一些视频博主，他们有麦克风之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9368.19, "timestamp": "02:36:08", "text": "有一天，我们拥有了那套设备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9371.19, "timestamp": "02:36:11", "text": "我觉得那家伙是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9373.91, "timestamp": "02:36:13", "text": "v 有 Sol 他那种风格，是的，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9376.87, "timestamp": "02:36:16", "text": "类似路边麦克风的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9380.389, "timestamp": "02:36:20", "text": "虽然有点奇怪，但这很酷"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9381.75, "timestamp": "02:36:21", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9384.309, "timestamp": "02:36:24", "text": "又来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9387.99, "timestamp": "02:36:27", "text": "呃，因为我五年级之后就要搬家了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9389.99, "timestamp": "02:36:29", "text": "没错，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9396.15, "timestamp": "02:36:36", "text": "我好像在担心要不要点餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9398.99, "timestamp": "02:36:38", "text": "这里的东西，或者如果我把所有东西都拍下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9401.23, "timestamp": "02:36:41", "text": "到我要搬去的地方或那天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9403.19, "timestamp": "02:36:43", "text": "在"}]